  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31662F00100002010000005C0D5427300200100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有張我推的人上傳的照片\n實在太讚了！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看一下！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67095F35621163A876844EBA4E0A50B3768471677247000A5BE65728592A8B9A4E86FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B4E004E0BFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這張卡娜莉小姐和麻麻鰻魚王\n在長椅上休息的照片，有夠神的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195F3553615A1C83895C0F59D0548C9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B000A5728957769054E0A4F11606F768471677247FF0C67095920795E7684FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也想坐在這張長椅上\n和雷電獸合照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F60F35750572890195F35957769054E0A000A548C96F796FB737854087167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我想拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的就是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C0010000201000000FF0C000A621160F362DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B376845C31662F2026202600100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請幫我找到照片裡的\n這張長椅！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB5E6B6211627E52307167724788E17684000A90195F3595776905FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啪靂霹靂！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "556A974297399742FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要看一下\n長椅的照片嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981770B4E004E0B000A9577690576847167724755CEFF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我看照片",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B936211770B716772470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不看也沒問題",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D770B4E5F6C92554F984C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是這張！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道這是哪裡的長椅嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F90195F35FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E590539019662F54EA88E176849577690555CEFF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請幫我找到照片裡的\n這張長椅！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB5E6B6211627E52307167724788E17684000A90195F3595776905FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發現了委託人要找的長椅！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C73FE4E8659D48A174EBA8981627E768495776905FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "2個並排的種植盆！\n背後的建築物！還有山！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0032500B4E26639276847A2E690D76C6FF01000A80CC5F8C76845EFA7BC97269FF01908467095C71FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉小姐的照片\n就是在這裡拍的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83895C0F59D0768471677247000A5C31662F5728901988E162CD7684FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，事不宜遲！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C4E8B4E0D5B9C9072FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我坐的長椅是卡娜莉小姐坐過的長椅，\n所以我就等於是卡娜莉小姐！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115750768495776905662F53615A1C83895C0F59D05750904E768495776905FF0C000A62404EE562115C317B4965BC662F53615A1C83895C0F59D0FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n可以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳參考卡娜莉小姐的照片，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n幫我拍張同樣感覺的照片嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A53EF4EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353C3800353615A1C83895C0F59D0768471677247FF0C00100001BE00000A5E6B621162CD5F35540C6A23611F89BA76847167724755CEFF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我\n完美重現這張照片的角度！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B6211000A5B8C7F8E91CD73FE90195F3571677247768489D25EA6FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想要確認照片時，\n隨時都可以跟我說一聲喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3898178BA8A8D716772476642FF0C000A96A8664290FD53EF4EE58DDF62118AAA4E0080725594FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要確認卡娜莉小姐的照片嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3898178BA8A8D53615A1C83895C0F59D076847167724755CEFF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用了<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D75284E8600100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳像卡娜莉小姐的照片那樣，\n從遠一點的地方幫我拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B350CF53615A1C83895C0F59D076847167724790A36A23FF0C000A5F9E90604E009EDE7684573065B95E6B621162CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯嗯！\n那附近感覺……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55EFFF01000A90A396448FD1611F89BA2026202600100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不太對。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好像角度不太一樣……\n畢竟我要的是完美重現嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D592A5C0D300200100001BE01000A597D50CF89D25EA64E0D592A4E006A2320262026000A75627ADF621189817684662F5B8C7F8E91CD73FE561BFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那裡那裡！\n請從那裡幫我拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A388E190A388E1FF01000A8ACB5F9E90A388E15E6B621162CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來來來～\n我來確認照片囉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F864F864F86FF5E000A62114F8678BA8A8D7167724756C9FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇喔！真的是完美重現！\n我就像是變身成卡娜莉小姐了耶！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C75594FF01771F7684662F5B8C7F8E91CD73FEFF01000A62115C3150CF662F8B8A8EAB621053615A1C83895C0F59D04E868036FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我拍的照片\n上傳到社群……去！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B621162CD768471677247000A4E0A50B35230793E7FA42026202653BBFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說，幫卡娜莉小姐拍照的人\n會不會就是傳說中的製作人呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAAFF0C5E6B53615A1C83895C0F59D062CD716776844EBA000A67034E0D67035C31662F50B38AAA4E2D768488FD4F5C4EBA5440FF1F00100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉麵包也不錯啦，\n但人家想要的是立牌或鑰匙圈之類的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83899EB553054E5F4E0D932F5566FF0C000A4F464EBA5BB660F389817684662F7ACB724C62169470531957084E4B985E7684300200100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只是說說而已啦！我還得去重現\n卡娜莉小姐其他的照片呢！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這才是我來密阿雷的目的呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA662F8AAA8AAA800C5DF25566FF01621190845F9753BB91CD73FE000A53615A1C83895C0F59D051764ED67684716772475462FF0100100001BE00000A9019624D662F62114F865BC6963F96F7768476EE76845440FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，也謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉！\n人都來了，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也在長椅休息一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4E5F8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B356C9FF01000A4EBA90FD4F864E86FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F5728957769054F11606F4E004E0B5427300200100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜～囉～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DCFF5E56C9FF5EFF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來我打算找出卡娜莉小姐\n舉辦問答大賽的地點來拍照！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B4F86621162537B97627E51FA53615A1C83895C0F59D0000A82098FA6554F7B5459278CFD768457309EDE4F8662CD7167FF0100100002011401AE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
